# Local reference projects and secrets
Ocean-AI/
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
# Any other env variant (.env.compose, .env.neon, ...); only examples are tracked
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Cloud credentials (e.g. a downloaded Firebase Admin key)
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*service_account*.json
**/firebase-admin*.json

# Local development artifacts
**/.venv/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/

# NNSight interpretability run logs (generated, accumulated across runs, not source)
nnsight/logger/logs/**/*.log
nnsight/logger/logs/**/*.json
!nnsight/logger/logs/.gitkeep
